{
  "_about": [
    "INTERNAL. Unit assemblies for the store construction quote. Never printed on customer documents.",
    "Each assembly: hrs = field labor hours per unit; mat = material cost per unit (true cost); sub = subcontract/pass-through cost per unit; eqp = furnished equipment cost per unit.",
    "Sell per unit = hrs*labor_billed_hr + mat*(1+material_markup) + sub*(1+sub_markup) + eqp*(1+equipment_markup). True cost = hrs*labor_true_cost_hr + mat + sub + eqp.",
    "basis = 'HELM:<anchor>' when calibrated to a pricing basis on file (sell matches the anchor to the dollar), else 'AEQ est - review'.",
    "section groups lines on the quote. Edgar rounds/overrides final numbers (overrides go in the store file, not here)."
  ],
